From 7b5d908748bc1854c614d2c09477e5ebe5e3bbdf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hanbang <hanbang@localhost>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:16:16 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] NGP Dual 1.2-os5: COMCREATEDATA returns FF when the send ring
 is full

When the 64-byte send ring is full, COMCREATEDATA now returns RA3 = 0xFF
instead of 2. Card Fighters' Clash puts its deck data one byte at a
time and retries when RA3 is 0xFF (ROM 0x242334); with 2 it took the
byte as sent, 32 bytes were lost and both machines stopped at
VS START COMMUNICATION. Now the match starts.

---
 mednafen/ngp/hb_link.c | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mednafen/ngp/hb_link.c b/mednafen/ngp/hb_link.c
index 21c071c..ea2f541 100644
--- a/mednafen/ngp/hb_link.c
+++ b/mednafen/ngp/hb_link.c
@@ -339,7 +339,10 @@ int hb_com_hle(uint32_t vector)
             COMMStatus &= ~1;
          return 1;
       case VECT_COMCREATEDATA:
-         rCodeB(0x30) = com_put(rCodeB(0x35)) ? COM_BUF_OK : COM_BUF_OVER;
+         /* (10/25 1.2-os5) 보낼 고리(64바이트)가 가득이면 0xFF — 카드 파이터즈는 덱 자료를 한 바이트씩 넣다가
+          * RA3 == 0xFF 면 COMSENDSTATUS · COMSENDSTART 뒤 다시 넣음(롬 0x242334). 예전 2 는 '넣었음'으로 보고 그 바이트를 버려
+          * 'VS START COMMUNICATION' 에서 둘 다 멈췄음 */
+         rCodeB(0x30) = com_put(rCodeB(0x35)) ? COM_BUF_OK : 0xFF;
          return 1;
       case VECT_COMGETDATA:
          if (com_get(&data))
-- 
